 position while having different budgets for social capital investments.
 The winner of such a game is promoted to a rich position (or maintains her rich position) by having the maximum total score comprising both of raw-talent 
\begin_inset Formula $r_{i}$
\end_inset

 (uniformly distributed in a population) and social capital 
\begin_inset Formula $s_{i}$
\end_inset

 (enhanced with expenditure).
 
