\begin_layout Standard
The long-term dynamics of this simple model are explored with two types of participants - the poor and the rich.
 The rich participants in the game benefit with a higher disposable income (
\begin_inset Formula $y_{2}$
\end_inset

) solely on grounds of their rich status while the poor participants receive a disposable income 
