 does admit that exclusionary boundaries constructed by social groups (social closure) can have significant economic consequences and that political processes are closely intertwined with economic structures.
 The idea that status is orthogonal to economic goals - or the 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

pure status
\begin_inset Quotes erd
